{"channelId":"UC8m2F-YhgMTksXg99oumAFA","row":["Milestones Physical Therapy Services",810,"My name is Lori Walker Krause and I am a Pediatric and Women's Health Physiotherapist in Calgary, Alberta, with 21 years of experience helping children and women live their best lives.  I am passionate about infant development, torticollis and plagiocephaly, pelvic floor physiotherapy for both children and women, and restorative core exercise for women at any stage of life.  I believe in the power of play, the power of movement, and the ability of appropriately prescribed and executed exercise to allow you to achieve maximal participation in and enjoyment of all the milestones of your life.","info@milestonesphyio.ca; info@milestonesphysio.ca","Canada"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC8m2F-YhgMTksXg99oumAFA","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC8m2F-YhgMTksXg99oumAFA","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:04:40.565Z","channelId":"UC8m2F-YhgMTksXg99oumAFA","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"ef97af325e5e006a21089b920f1339545d68cc030602ce184ae055f1e7dcfcca","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"a39fa8e6f3710ff8e04a436f72846b6766b399e304d21605277eb5502395f69c"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC8m2F-YhgMTksXg99oumAFA","observedAt":"2026-09-18T08:41:35.761Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC8m2F-YhgMTksXg99oumAFA","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":810,"raw":"810 subscribers","precision":"exact","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC8m2F-YhgMTksXg99oumAFA","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:04:40.565Z"}],"emails":[{"address":"info@milestonesphyio.ca","purpose":"general","ownerRole":"unknown","identityStatus":"cross_linked","sourceUrls":["https://milestonesphysio.ca/"],"evidenceIds":["public-page:fc0210484f71f3df45888676"],"observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:33:40.815Z","deliveryVerified":false,"dnsStatus":"unknown","context":"页面原文: EMAIL NOW\nHTML h